OL,3,GNEWSAMonster cabbage gift helps feed
OL,4,Arescue animals
OL,5,
OL,6,FGiant cabbages grown for a National
OL,7,FTrust competition have been donated to
OL,8,Fa rescue centre to feed hungry animals.
OL,10,FGardeners at Buckland Abbey in
OL,11,FYelverton grew a number of Cornish
OL,12,FGiant cabbages, one of which was 1.2
OL,13,Fmetres (47.2 inches) across and weighed
OL,14,Fabout 10kg (22lbs) - which won the
OL,15,Fcompetition for the biggest across
OL,16,Ftrust sites in Devon and Cornwall "by a
OL,17,Fcountry mile".
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
