OL,3,GNEWSAMonster cabbage gift helps feed
OL,4,Arescue animals
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree of the large brassicas were taken
OL,7,Fto the Woodside Animal Sanctuary in
OL,8,FPlympton to help feed its sheep, pigs,
OL,9,Fgoats, turkeys, rabbits and guinea
OL,10,Fpigs.
OL,12,FGardener Sam Brown said the cabbages,
OL,13,Fwhich are "often bred for exhibition",
OL,14,Fwere "really good fun to grow" but were
OL,15,Fbest suited for animal consumption.
